# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository AND in the working
# tree. Without this, core.autocrlf on Windows checks files out as CRLF
# while Prettier's default endOfLine is "lf" — so `npm run format:check`
# flagged all 52 files and hid the handful with real formatting drift.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
